      <marc:subfield code="a">In Fearless and Free Wendy Sachs reveals the issues and self-imposed barriers that hold women back; from perfectionism, to fear of failure, to using power-draining words like &quot;sorry&quot;. Using the model of Silicon Valley, the motherland of innovation with its confident, agile, fail fast, fail often culture, she discovers the patterns, themes and secrets for success. Sharing these lessons, Sachs empowers women to be fearless and flexible, to pivot or totally relaunch careers.</marc:subfield>
